The final game rules are:

RULE 1:
Players enter their name.

RULE 2:
Players choose one cartoon animal avatar.

RULE 3:
Players enter the live lobby.

RULE 4:
Maximum default players = 40.

RULE 5:
Players wait until admin starts the match.

RULE 6:
Admin controls the match.

RULE 7:
Round 1 is a simple image rearrangement puzzle.

RULE 8:
Players arrange the pieces into the correct original image.

RULE 9:
Round 1 awards score based on the configured scoring system.

RULE 10:
Round 2 is the hard puzzle.

RULE 11:
Round 2 has a 10-minute shared authoritative timer.

RULE 12:
When the timer reaches zero, unfinished players receive Game Over.

RULE 13:
Completed players receive their final score.

RULE 14:
The server determines valid completion.

RULE 15:
No duplicate score is possible.

RULE 16:
No duplicate player session is possible.

RULE 17:
No client can modify another player's data.

RULE 18:
No client can modify their own score.

RULE 19:
Admin actions are authenticated.

RULE 20:
The entire system must gracefully handle network problems.

